Package: synveil
Version: @SYNVEIL_VERSION@
Architecture: @SYNVEIL_ARCH@
Maintainer: Synveil Project <synveil-dev@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SYNVEIL_INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SYNVEIL_DEPENDS@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Synveil scheduled backup maintenance runtime (Linux Gen-1)
 Synveil Gen-1 one-shot scheduled-maintenance runtime with systemd
 timer/service lifecycle, systemd-sysusers/tmpfiles identity, and
 LoadCredential database-credential delivery.
 .
 This package contains the release binary, systemd units, sysusers/tmpfiles
 fragments, and a non-secret configuration template. It does NOT contain
 database credentials; the administrator provisions
 /etc/synveil/credentials/database-url (root:root 0600) separately.
 Timer is NOT auto-enabled and service is NOT auto-started on install;
 enable explicitly after configuring credentials.
 .
 Package signing and APT repository publishing are deferred to release
 engineering (unsigned CI artifact at this stage).
